{"unit_id":"yishengdaxiaonengjihui__dsh-poor-router#card-zh","repo":"yishengdaxiaonengjihui/dsh-poor-router","commit":"722798952af78a3f6d48ce9dbbc334a00eed0c75","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-poor-router 是面向 DSH 网页端的模型池路由插件。它接入 llm/stream 请求钩子，并提供设置页仪表盘和输入框改道指示。插件按模型记录调用、成功失败、延迟和 token 用量，依据近期健康状态自适应选择候选模型；模型冷却或时段拥塞时，可按质量档尝试其他模型。辅助请求还能使用执行者池，工具可查看状态或调整路由、模型档位和额度。模型池与状态保存在本地 JSON 文件，用户可配置路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:444-495","lib/index.js:665-669","lib/client.js:371-379"]}
{"unit_id":"yishengdaxiaonengjihui__dsh-poor-router#card-en","repo":"yishengdaxiaonengjihui/dsh-poor-router","commit":"722798952af78a3f6d48ce9dbbc334a00eed0c75","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-poor-router routes DSH web requests across model pools using usage and health data. It reroutes cooled models by quality tier and directs auxiliary requests to executor models. Agent tools manage the pool; a web dashboard edits tiers and grants, and an input badge shows reroutes.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:444-495","lib/index.js:665-669","lib/client.js:371-379"]}
